{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-photon-threading-mass","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:photon-threading-mass","kind":"proposition","title":"Mass as photon threading cost","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-mass-identity"],"tags":["mass","photon","groebner-shirshov","hecke","braid","yekutieli","speed-of-light"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Information.photon_threading_mass","text":"photon-threading-mass.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:photon-threading-mass\"></a><p><em>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{H}</code> be a knot composite with braid word <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta_{\\mathfrak{H}} \\in B_n</code>. The categorical mass <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{m}_{\\mathfrak{H}}</code> (<a href=\"#def:mass-identity\" data-at=\"mass-endomorphism/mass-endomorphism-opener/mass-endomorphism-mass-identity\">mass identity</a>) equals the total Gröbner--Shirshov reduction cost of threading the photon strand <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\gamma</code> through the hadron braid:</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathfrak{m}_{\\mathfrak{H}}\n  =  (q - 1)^2 \\sum_{\\text{Hecke steps}}\n  |c_w| \\cdot |q - q^{-1}|.</code></pre>\n<p><em>The sum runs over all Hecke reductions <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_i^2 \\to (q - q^{-1})\\sigma_i + 1</code> required to move the photon strand from above <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta_{\\mathfrak{H}}</code> to below <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta_{\\mathfrak{H}}</code> in the augmented braid <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\gamma \\otimes \\beta_{\\mathfrak{H}} \\in B_{n+1}</code>. The values <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_w</code> denote the coefficients at each step.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/photon-threading-mass.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"22.4.9","page":"b/prop-photon-threading-mass","qa":{"counts":{"pass":87,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":74},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.InformationTheory.photon_threading_mass","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/InformationTheory/photon_threading_mass.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
